<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to firm, compared to last week's close, USDA said. Feeder Steers:  Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 72.50-77.50; 700-800 lbs 70.00-77.00; 800-900 lbs 64.50-67.25. Small 1 300-400 lbs 66.50-67.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers:  Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 65.50-69.75; 700-800 lbs 63.775-67.75.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts:  2,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
